README

The files in this folder contain global phase velocity maps. The format is as follows:
Column 1: Longitude
Column 2: Latitude
Column 3: Phase Velocity (km/s);

To use these files to compute PIA predictions, you may consider the following.

For example, for S362ANI at 50 s:

Map = load('LON_LAT_C_S362ANI_Period_50s');
Longitude = Map(:,1);
Latitude = Map(:,2);
PhVel = Map(:,3);

[AAlist] = Calculate_Arrival_Angle_WW86_AllinOne_ArbitraryModel(lon_src,lat_src,lon_stas,lat_stas, Longitude, Latitude, PhVel)